  "problem": "If $\\overset{\u2015}{X}={2.1,\\pi ,\\sqrt{7},11}$ and $\\overset{\u2015}{Y}={2,\\pi ,11},$ then what is $\\overset{\u2015}{X\\cup Y}?$",
